        "uid_offset_key": "tt_content",
        "fal": [
          {
            "fieldname": "image",
            "count_field": "image"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "tt_content uses l18n_parent (legacy column name). alternative/title/description live on sys_file_reference and are translated with the parent. Typolink targets + icon/accent + pi_flexform are copy_fields (TCA l10n_mode=exclude where applicable); CTA labels and hero eyebrow/badge are translated."
